{"seq":3,"slug":"medical-imaging","title":"医学影像分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/cv-applications/medical-imaging","wordCount":1072,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"医学影像分析\">医学影像分析</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>医学影像分析将计算机视觉技术应用于 X 光、CT、MRI、超声和病理切片等医学图像的自动解读。医学 AI 的目标是辅助医生提高诊断效率和准确性，而非替代医生。医学影像数据与自然图像存在显著差异——高位深度、三维体积、标注稀缺和分布偏移等特点使得通用视觉模型不能直接迁移，需要针对性的技术方案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[医学影像] --&gt; B{任务类型}&#10;    B --&gt; C[病灶检测]&#10;    B --&gt; D[影像分割]&#10;    B --&gt; E[分类诊断]&#10;    B --&gt; F[影像配准]&#10;    C --&gt; G[标注定位异常区域]&#10;    D --&gt; H[器官/病灶边界]&#10;    E --&gt; I[良恶性判断]&#10;    F --&gt; J[多时相对齐]\">graph LR\n    A[医学影像] --&gt; B{任务类型}\n    B --&gt; C[病灶检测]\n    B --&gt; D[影像分割]\n    B --&gt; E[分类诊断]\n    B --&gt; F[影像配准]\n    C --&gt; G[标注定位异常区域]\n    D --&gt; H[器官/病灶边界]\n    E --&gt; I[良恶性判断]\n    F --&gt; J[多时相对齐]</pre><p>医学影像分析面临的核心挑战包括：标注数据极度稀缺（专家标注成本极高）、类别严重不均衡（正常远多于异常）、分布偏移（不同设备、不同医院的数据分布差异）和可解释性要求（医生需要理解 AI 的决策依据）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>影像类型</th>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>位深度</th>\n<th>典型任务</th>\n<th>常用模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>X 光片</td>\n<td>2D</td>\n<td>12-16 bit</td>\n<td>肺部异常检测</td>\n<td>DenseNet, ResNet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CT 扫描</td>\n<td>3D</td>\n<td>12 bit (HU)</td>\n<td>肺结节检测、器官分割</td>\n<td>3D U-Net, nnU-Net</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MRI</td>\n<td>3D 多序列</td>\n<td>12-16 bit</td>\n<td>脑肿瘤分割、膝关节分析</td>\n<td>nnU-Net, SwinUNETR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超声</td>\n<td>2D/3D</td>\n<td>8 bit</td>\n<td>胎儿检测、甲状腺诊断</td>\n<td>YOLOv8, U-Net</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>病理切片</td>\n<td>2D 超大</td>\n<td>8 bit RGB</td>\n<td>细胞分类、组织分割</td>\n<td>MIL, CLAM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>眼底照片</td>\n<td>2D</td>\n<td>8 bit RGB</td>\n<td>糖尿病视网膜病变</td>\n<td>EfficientNet</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"u-net-与医学影像分割\">U-Net 与医学影像分割</h2><p>U-Net 是医学影像分割的经典基线模型，其对称的编码器-解码器结构配合密集跳跃连接，在小数据集上也能取得出色效果。U-Net 的成功证明了跳跃连接对于恢复医学图像中精细结构（如血管、组织边界）的重要性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class DoubleConv(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_ch, out_ch):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.conv = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(in_ch, out_ch, 3, padding=1),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(out_ch, out_ch, 3, padding=1),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        return self.conv(x)&#10;&#10;class UNet(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_channels=1, num_classes=2):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.enc1 = DoubleConv(in_channels, 64)&#10;        self.enc2 = DoubleConv(64, 128)&#10;        self.enc3 = DoubleConv(128, 256)&#10;        self.bottleneck = DoubleConv(256, 512)&#10;        self.up3 = nn.ConvTranspose2d(512, 256, 2, 2)&#10;        self.dec3 = DoubleConv(512, 256)&#10;        self.up2 = nn.ConvTranspose2d(256, 128, 2, 2)&#10;        self.dec2 = DoubleConv(256, 128)&#10;        self.up1 = nn.ConvTranspose2d(128, 64, 2, 2)&#10;        self.dec1 = DoubleConv(128, 64)&#10;        self.out = nn.Conv2d(64, num_classes, 1)&#10;        self.pool = nn.MaxPool2d(2)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        e1 = self.enc1(x)&#10;        e2 = self.enc2(self.pool(e1))&#10;        e3 = self.enc3(self.pool(e2))&#10;        b = self.bottleneck(self.pool(e3))&#10;        d3 = self.dec3(torch.cat([self.up3(b), e3], dim=1))&#10;        d2 = self.dec2(torch.cat([self.up2(d3), e2], dim=1))&#10;        d1 = self.dec1(torch.cat([self.up1(d2), e1], dim=1))&#10;        return self.out(d1)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DoubleConv</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_ch, out_ch):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(in_ch, out_ch, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(out_ch, out_ch, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UNet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</spa