\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        e1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.enc1(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        e2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.enc2(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pool(e1))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        e3 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.enc3(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pool(e2))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bottleneck(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pool(e3))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        d3 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dec3(torch.cat([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.up3(b), e3], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        d2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dec2(torch.cat([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.up2(d3), e2], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        d1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dec1(torch.cat([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.up1(d2), e1], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.out(d1)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>nnU-Net 是医学影像分割的&quot;自适应框架&quot;。它根据数据集的特性（图像尺寸、间距、类别数量等）自动配置网络架构、训练策略和后处理流水线，在 30+ 个医学分割基准上达到了最优或接近最优的性能，无需人工调参。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph nnU-Net 自动配置&#10;        A[数据集分析] --&gt; B[指纹提取]&#10;        B --&gt; C{架构选择}&#10;        C --&gt; D[2D U-Net]&#10;        C --&gt; E[3D U-Net]&#10;        C --&gt; F[3D Cascade]&#10;        D --&gt; G[自动配置超参数]&#10;        E --&gt; G&#10;        F --&gt; G&#10;        G --&gt; H[训练+五折交叉验证]&#10;        H --&gt; I[集成+后处理]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph nnU-Net 自动配置\n        A[数据集分析] --&gt; B[指纹提取]\n        B --&gt; C{架构选择}\n        C --&gt; D[2D U-Net]\n        C --&gt; E[3D U-Net]\n        C --&gt; F[3D Cascade]\n        D --&gt; G[自动配置超参数]\n        E --&gt; G\n        F --&gt; G\n        G --&gt; H[训练+五折交叉验证]\n        H --&gt; I[集成+后处理]\n    end</pre><p>SwinUNETR 将 Swin Transformer 作为编码器引入医学影像分割，通过窗口化自注意力高效处理三维医学体积数据。在 BraTS 脑肿瘤分割和 BTCV 多器官分割等基准上，SwinUNETR 展现出了超越纯 CNN 方法的性能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小数据学习与预训练策略\">小数据学习与预训练策略</h2><p>医学影像标注需要领域专家（放射科医生、病理医生），标注成本极高。解决标注数据稀缺问题的主要策略包括：自监督预训练、半监督学习和主动学习。</p>\n<p>医学影像的自监督预训练方法包括：对比学习（将同一患者不同视角或时相的图像作为正样本对）、掩码建模（随机遮挡三维体积的部分区域并预测被遮挡内容）和生成式预训练（重建去噪图像）。这些方法在仅有少量标注数据时显著提升下游任务性能。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class MedicalSSL(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, encoder, proj_dim=128):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.encoder = encoder&#10;        self.projector = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Linear(512, 256),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Linear(256, proj_dim),&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def contrastive_loss(self, z1, z2, temperature=0.07):&#10;        z1 = nn.functional.normalize(z1, dim=1)&#10;        z2 = nn.functional.normalize(z2, dim=1)&#10;        similarity = torch.mm(z1, z2.T) / temperature&#10;        labels = torch.arange(z1.size(0), device=z1.device)&#10;        loss = nn.functional.cross_entropy(similarity, labels)&#10;        return loss&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, view1, view2):&#10;        h1 = self.encoder(view1).mean(dim=(-2, -1))&#10;        h2 = self.encoder(view2).mean(dim=(-2, -1))&#10;        z1 = self.projector(h1)&#10;        z2 = self.projector(h2)&#10;        return self.contrastive_loss(z1, z2)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MedicalSSL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, encoder, proj_dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.projector </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, proj_dim),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> contrastive_loss</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, z1, z2, temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.07</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        z1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.functional.normalize(z1, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        z2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.functional.normalize(z2, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        similarity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.mm(z1, z2.T) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temperature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.arange(z1.size(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">z1.device)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.functional.cross_entropy(similarity, labels)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loss</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, view1, view2):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        h1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder(view1).mean(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        h2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder(view2).mean(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        z1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.projector(h1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        z2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.projector(h2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.contrastive_loss(z1, z2)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SAM-Med2D 和 MedSAM 将 Segment Anything Model 适配到医学影像领域，通过在大规模医学分割数据上微调 SAM，实现了通用的交互式医学影像分割。用户可以通过点击或框选来指导分割，大幅降低了标注工作量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>标注需求</th>\n<th>效果提升</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ImageNet 预训练</td>\n<td>2D 影像</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自监督预训练</td>\n<td>任意维度</td>\n<td>少量</td>\n<td>10-20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半监督学习</td>\n<td>标注受限</td>\n<td>极少</td>\n<td>8-15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主动学习</td>\n<td>标注预算有限</td>\n<td>自适应</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MedSAM 提示分割</td>\n<td>交互式标注</td>\n<td>点击/框</td>\n<td>大幅降低标注量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((医学影像分析))&#10;    分割模型&#10;      U-Net&#10;      nnU-Net&#10;      SwinUNETR&#10;    小数据策略&#10;      自监督预训练&#10;      半监督学习&#10;      MedSAM&#10;    临床应用&#10;      肺结节检测&#10;      脑肿瘤分割&#10;      病理分析\">mindmap\n  root((医学影像分析))\n    分割模型\n      U-Net\n      nnU-Net\n      SwinUNETR\n    小数据策略\n      自监督预训练\n      半监督学习\n      MedSAM\n    临床应用\n      肺结节检测\n      脑肿瘤分割\n      病理分析</pre><ul>\n<li>医学影像与自然图像差异显著，需要针对性的技术方案</li>\n<li>U-Net 是医学分割的经典基线，nnU-Net 通过自动配置在大量基准上达到最优</li>\n<li>标注数据稀缺是医学 AI 的核心瓶颈，自监督预训练和 MedSAM 是有效的解决方案</li>\n<li>Dice Loss 和 Dice + CrossEntropy 组合是医学分割训练的标准损失函数</li>\n<li>可解释性对于临床部署至关重要，GradCAM 等方法帮助医生理解模型决策</li>\n<li>医学 AI 产品需要通过严格的监管审批流程才能用于临床</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"医学影像分析","id":"医学影像分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"U-Net 与医学影像分割","id":"u-net-与医学影像分割"},{"level":2,"text":"小数据学习与预训练策略","id":"小数据学习与预训练策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"OCR 与文档处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/cv-applications/ocr-document"},"next":{"title":"自动驾驶感知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/cv-applications/autonomous-perception"}}